Root cause found: Tauri's dragDropEnabled=true (in tauri.conf.json line 23) enables Tauri's native file drop handler which intercepts ALL drag events at the WKWebView level on macOS, preventing HTML5 DOM DnD from working. Setting to false fixes it. Found via https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/14373 and https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/discussions/9696. The overlay approach from the previous commit is still useful as defense-in-depth against SvelteFlow swallowing events.
